 The API takes about a second per call and has short outages (`503`) a few times a week.
 
+## PartnerManifestSensor
+
+Deferrable by default: it waits on the triggerer, so `partners` must be importable there
+just as it is on the workers. `timeout` covers the whole DAG run. Retries and triggerer
+restarts don't reset it; clearing the task does. The start of each wait is kept in a
+Variable `partner_manifest_sensor__<dag>__<run>__<task>__<map_index>`, which is removed
+when the wait ends. API errors fail the try, so retries apply, even with `soft_fail`.
